From 2dcb073600010d98024b54ac93f3fa972748e9c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LibreMoto Build <libre-moto@jacksitlab.de>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:31:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(aidl): expose nearby roads vector data via
 getNearbyRoads()
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add AIDL V2 method getNearbyRoads(centerLat, centerLon, radiusM, maxRoads)
that queries loaded .obf vector tiles for road polylines within a bbox.
Returns List<ARoadPolyline> with WGS84 points, road name, and highway type.
Uses getReverseGeocodingMapFiles() readers, checks highway tag on all
objects (no LINE_RULES filter — REVERSE_GEOCODING readers set different
objectType values).
